Package: grainSizeTools
Title: Grain Size Analysis Tools for Laser Particle Size Analyser Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Andrew", "Oordt", email = "andrewoordt@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for analysing and visualising grain size data from laser
    particle size analysers (LPSA). Generates HTML reports comparing soil
    profiles, plotting USDA textural triangles, and assessing replicate
    consistency via coefficient of variation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
